From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:34:32 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mount: Use a single OSGeo4W root instead of the Cygwin mount
 table


diff --git a/mount.cc b/mount.cc
index e1ed6d7..0e2eddb 100644
--- a/mount.cc
+++ b/mount.cc
@@ -1,6 +1,5 @@
 /*
